  "name": "Question 7",
  "problem": "Translate the following phrase into an algebraic expression: \"The quotient of a number and two less than that number.\"",
  "worked_solution": "If we denote our number by $x$, then \"two less than that number\" can be written as\n\n$$\nx-2.\n$$\n\nSo, the whole phrase can be written as \n\n$$\n\\frac{x}{x-2}.\n$$",
